## 🎨 **PART 6: Storage & Infrastructure**

### **6.1 File Storage (S3/Supabase Storage)**

```
f3next-mvp/
├── {project_id}/
    ├── raw/
    │   └── intake.json
    ├── templates/
    │   ├── items.csv
    │   ├── bom.csv
    │   └── customers.csv
    ├── uploads/
    │   ├── items_uploaded.csv
    │   └── bom_uploaded.csv
    └── validation/
        └── report_{upload_id}.json

```

### **6.2 Vector Database (Pinecone/Qdrant)**

**Single collection:**

```
project_summaries
├── id: project_id
├── vector: embedding(intake_data + recommendation)
├── metadata: {industry, size, modules, erp_choice}

```

**Purpose:** Find similar past projects to inform discovery

### **6.3 Cache (Redis)**

```
redis:session:{session_id}     # Session data (TTL: 24h)
redis:project:{project_id}     # Project cache (TTL: 1h)

```

