## ✅ **PART 10: Definition of Done (MVP Complete)**

Your MVP is DONE when:

1. ✅ User can fill intake form
2. ✅ System generates ERP recommendation in <2 min
3. ✅ User receives downloadable CSV templates
4. ✅ User can upload their data files
5. ✅ System validates and shows errors within 1 min
6. ✅ You receive email notification to manually review
7. ✅ Demo video works end-to-end with dummy data
8. ✅ One real customer has used it with real data

**NOT required for MVP:**

- ❌ Automated mapping
- ❌ Dry-run import to ERPNext
- ❌ Production import
- ❌ Training material generation
- ❌ Support chatbot
- ❌ Multi-tenant infrastructure
- ❌ Payment integration
- ❌ Perfect UI/UX

